####################### adding advisors

@add_advisors
title: Add advisors
choose-if: n_advisors < 3
unavailable-subtitle: Maximum of 3 advisors.
go-to: advisor_menu

@advisor_menu
title: Add other advisors.
tags: center_advisor, left_advisor, reformist_advisor, labor_advisor, neorev_advisor, nonfactional_advisor
frequency: 1


- @centrist: Add Centrists
- @left: Add Leftists
- @reformist: Add Reformists
- @labor: Add Labor
- @neorev: Add Neorevisionists
- @nonfactional: Add non-factional advisors
- @rm_main: Remove advisors instead.
- @remove_none: Stop changing advisors.

@centrist
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #center_advisor

@reformist
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #reformist_advisor

@left
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #left_advisor

@labor
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #labor_advisor

@neorev
view-if: neorevisionism > 0 and n_advisors < 3

- #neorev_advisor

@nonfactional
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #nonfactional_advisor

@add_hobhouse
title: John A. Hobhouse
subtitle: John A. Hobhouse is a polticial theorist and sociologist, And a founding figure in the social liberal movement.
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/HilferdingRudolf.jpg
tags: center_advisor
view-if: hobhouse_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3 and centrists_resign = 0
on-arrival: hobhouse_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu

John A. Hobhouse is now an advisor.

@add_simon
title: John Simon
subtitle: John Simon is the former solicitor general of Wales and England. He is an outspoken protectionist and a right wing liberal.
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/WelsRudolf.jpg
tags: center_advisor
view-if: simon_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3 and centrists_resign = 0
on-arrival: simon_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu

John Simon is now an advisor.

@add_asquith
title: H.H Asquith
subtitle: H.H Asquith is a former [? if chancellor = "Müller": and current ?] PM and leader of the Liberals after David Lloyd George left.
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/MüllerHermann.jpg
tags: center_advisor
view-if: asquith_advisor = 0 and muller_dead = 0 and n_advisors < 3 and centrists_resign = 0
on-arrival: asquith_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu

H.H Asquith is now an advisor.

@add_harmsworth
title: Lord Harmsworth
subtitle: Lord Harmsworth is the former Under-Secretary of State for Foreign Affairs from David Lloyd George's cabinet. Although he was briefly a National Liberal, He rejoined the true Liberal party only a year afterwards.
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/BreitscheidRudolf.jpg
view-if: harmsworth_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3
on-arrival: harmsworth_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu
tags: center_advisor

Lord Harmsworth is now an advisor.

# reformist


@add_wintrigham
title: Margaret Wintringham
subtitle: Margaret Wintringham is the first female Liberal MP and the first British-born female MP. She campaigns for equal pay and women-only spaces. She is also the head of the Women's Liberal Association.
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/SeveringCarl.jpg
tags: reformist_advisor
view-if: wintrignham_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3
on-arrival: wintrignham_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1; reformist_strength += 5
go-to: advisor_menu

Margaret Wintringham is now an advisor.

@add_lewis
title: Herbert Lewis
subtitle: Herbert Lewis [? if spd_prussia = 1 : is ?][? if spd_prussia = 0 : was ?] one of the main Welsh Liberal polticans. He is the former MP for Flintshire and University of Wales. Despite being apart of the main Liberal Party, He is still close with Lloyd George- As evidenced by his OBE in the 1922 Dissolution Honours.
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/BraunOtto.jpg
tags: reformist_advisor
view-if: lewis_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3
on-arrival: lewis_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1; reformist_strength += 5
go-to: advisor_menu

Herbert Lewis is now an advisor.

